--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Relationship to AscendNPU-IR
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project is a pure downstream consumer of AscendNPU-IR: it depends on the
BiShengIR MLIR Python bindings (`bishengir`) as a runtime environment dependency
and does not vendor, modify, or redistribute AscendNPU-IR source code. The HIVM
semantic descriptions under `specs/` are independently authored models of
observable dialect semantics, cross-validated against the upstream
implementation as described in docs/design-framework.md §8.
